  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;taken by the person to travel distance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;with velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>The time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;taken by the person to travel distance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;with velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the average speed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>v</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;of the person is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the expressions from equations (1) and (2) into equation (3) to obtain the required relation.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>v</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
